    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 关于本期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>上辈子造大孽，这辈子服务业。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们集结多个行业的打工人，全员跨界唠嗑，疯狂吐槽工作里那些让人乳腺结节的奇葩客户、离谱投诉、无解奇葩需求。</span></p><span></span><p><span>被奇葩要求狠狠暴击的日常，一次性大公开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>各行各业各有苦衷，万物皆可服务，人人皆可吐槽。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完这期，愿所有服务业打工人，少遇奇葩，多遇温柔。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 参与录制</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>全员匿名：凉水铺德叔，进出口专业人员，美容院煮粥姐，文字码农，鼓浪屿萍姐，三轮车铁柱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 后期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>天爵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 时码</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 在小超市遇到爱占小便宜的顾客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 纹眉后离婚马上投诉医美机构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 沉迷在医美机构领面膜的顾客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 爱抽查提问的客户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> 金融业者奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 奇葩的酒旅从业人员和奇葩的酒旅客户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">36:21</a> 遇上私生员工了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> 随地大小吐的牙科患者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 粥底火锅冒泡竟是因为……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>01. 속삭여줘 _ SORAN</span></p><span></span><p><span>02. New order _ 陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 备注</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>更多演出信息欢迎关注公众号@分子喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>分子聊养院建立听友群了，如果想进听友群，请添加微信fenzixiju</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您有更多有趣的想法与建议，也可以与我们畅谈。</span></p>]]></description>
