    <title>EP49 线下聊天会 | 职场吐槽大会——新年新气象，奇葩快退散</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69938a17de29766da9c44a0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69938a17de29766da9c44a0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Feb 2026 21:29:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>^ • ^ /关于本期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>各位叔伯兄弟姊妹，新年好！今日是大年初一，聊养院和大家拜年啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>尤其祝大家新的一年龙马精神，升职加薪，职场无小人，做事兴旺顺！​</span></p><span></span><p><span>分子聊养院正月初一特别放送《职场吐槽大会》——新年新气象，糟心事全部丢掉！</span></p><span></span><p><span>新年换新衫，本期节目打开“吐槽模式”，收录超多真人真事：</span></p><span></span><p><span>从“捣塑料”成果被同事占去领功，到遇上老板亲戚害自己反复背锅；</span></p><span></span><p><span>从上厕所不洗手的同事，到每日关心你婚事多过关心工作的阿姨；</span></p><span></span><p><span>更有同事在直播间偷情被发现等离奇剧情，也有老板亲自下场——“销冠为何得不到销冠待遇？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>点击收听，一起笑闹中解压，过个轻松年！</span></p><span></span><p><span>新的一年，愿大家工作如鱼得水，烦恼统统“嘭”掉！​</span></p><span></span><p><span>老爷保号，事业顺利！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ /后期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>天爵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 时码</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 占用我“捣塑料”成果的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 老板亲戚害我反复被人骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 夹着尾巴做人的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 没有边界感让我干活的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 顶级摆烂的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 上厕所不洗手的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 每天催我婚的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 用1000多张欢迎信欢迎一名同事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 同事在直播间偷情被发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 借钱跑路的保安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> 来认识我的酸鸡同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a> 我的戏精（帝政）同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> 柬埔寨招工奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3333">55:33</a> 老板代表下场回应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3513">58:33</a> 略显蹊跷的考勤办法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3734">01:02:14</a> 我是销冠但得不到销冠的待遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4370">01:12:50</a> 真的很难共情老板啊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>01. 속삭여줘 _ SORAN</span></p><span></span><p><span>02. 你最红 _ Twins</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>^ • ^ / 备注</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>更多演出信息欢迎关注公众号@分子喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>分子聊养院建立听友群了，如果想进听友群，请添加微信fenzixiju</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您有更多有趣的想法与建议，也可以与我们畅谈。</span></p>]]></description>
